    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small venue, attract players to your football facility, expand your business and fill your arcade with fun machines and activities.<br>From managing football bookings to handling tokens and profits from arcade machines, it's your job to grow your entertainment empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a fully functional 5-a-side football pitch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and unlock a variety of arcade machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your entertainment area and football facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle tokens and profits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract different types of NPCs with unique needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your venue layout</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you build the ultimate sports and entertainment complex? The success of your business depends on your management skills!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small venue, attract players to your football facility, expand your business and fill your arcade with fun machines and activities.<br>From managing football bookings to handling tokens and profits from arcade machines, it's your job to grow your entertainment empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a fully functional 5-a-side football pitch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and unlock a variety of arcade machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your entertainment area and football facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle tokens and profits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract different types of NPCs with unique needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your venue layout</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you build the ultimate sports and entertainment complex? The success of your business depends on your management skills!</p>",
    "short_description": "Manage a football pitch and arcade! Upgrade machines, attract players and build your ultimate fun center.",
